menu "Bench harness options"
    config BENCH_AES_SWEEP_ONLY
        bool "Run only the AES-GCM sweep (skip Ascon + ML-KEM)"
        default n
        help
            Set to y by the aes-sw build presets so the sw-only run doesn't
            waste time re-measuring Ascon/ML-KEM, which the primary preset
            already covers.
endmenu